# AWS Serverless Cost Optimizer

A serverless cost-optimization tool built with **AWS Lambda, Python, Boto3, CloudWatch, EventBridge Scheduler, and SNS**.

It runs daily, detects potentially unused AWS resources, and sends an email report.

## Architecture
EventBridge Scheduler
        ↓
AWS Lambda
        ↓
EC2, EBS and CloudWatch checks
        ↓
Amazon SNS
        ↓
Email report


## Features

- Detects EC2 instances averaging below **5% CPU over 14 days**
- Finds unattached EBS volumes
- Finds unassociated Elastic IPs
- Reports EBS snapshots older than **60 days**
- Identifies snapshots whose source volumes no longer exist
- Sends automated SNS email reports

